    {
      "id": "nqKpIh87INk9SFRzdZEx_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 318.01171875,
      "y": 3243.56640625,
      "width": 1031.979248046875,
      "height": 1225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 233745471,
      "version": 1121,
      "versionNonce": 616568914,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783518266643,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "backward propagation:\n\ndl/dw11 = dl/dy * dy/dz * dz/da * da/dw11 \n\ncross entropy loss :\n\ndl/dy = -y/ypred\n\ndy/dz --> computing this is use more computation, instead we can compute dl/dz which is minimal compute.\n\nsoftmax + cross entropy loss:\n\ndl/dz =  ypred - y, for batch 1/m(ypred - y) --> to avoid gradient explosion\n\n\ndl/da = dl/dz * dz/da = backward(relu) = {1 if a >0 and o a<=0}\n       find index where x <=0 , set those values to 0. \n\n- weights\n\ndl/dw = dl/dz * dz/dw11 \n\ndz/dw11 = x11.w11 +x12.w21+ x13.w31 = x1 \n\ndl/dw11 = dl/dz * x1\n\nX = [x1 x2 x3    --> first row of inputs.     dl-dz= \n          \n      \n\n\ndl/dw = [dl/dz1.x1 dl/dz1. x2 dl/dz1.x3\n\n           dl/dz2.x1 dl/dz2.x2 dl/dz2.x3\n\n          dl/dz3.x1, dl.dz3.x2, dl/dz3.x3]\n\n\ndl/dw = XT. dl/dz\n\n- biases\n    \ndl/db = dl/dz * dl/db = Sumofbatch( dl/dz) - sum across rows\n\n- inputs:\n\ndl/dx = dl/dz1 * w11 + dl/dz2 * w21 + dl/dz3 * w31\n\ndl/dx = dl/dz * WT",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "backward propagation:\n\ndl/dw11 = dl/dy * dy/dz * dz/da * da/dw11 \n\ncross entropy loss :\n\ndl/dy = -y/ypred\n\ndy/dz --> computing this is use more computation, instead we can compute dl/dz which is minimal compute.\n\nsoftmax + cross entropy loss:\n\ndl/dz =  ypred - y, for batch 1/m(ypred - y) --> to avoid gradient explosion\n\n\ndl/da = dl/dz * dz/da = backward(relu) = {1 if a >0 and o a<=0}\n       find index where x <=0 , set those values to 0. \n\n- weights\n\ndl/dw = dl/dz * dz/dw11 \n\ndz/dw11 = x11.w11 +x12.w21+ x13.w31 = x1 \n\ndl/dw11 = dl/dz * x1\n\nX = [x1 x2 x3    --> first row of inputs.     dl-dz= \n          \n      \n\n\ndl/dw = [dl/dz1.x1 dl/dz1. x2 dl/dz1.x3\n\n           dl/dz2.x1 dl/dz2.x2 dl/dz2.x3\n\n          dl/dz3.x1, dl.dz3.x2, dl/dz3.x3]\n\n\ndl/dw = XT. dl/dz\n\n- biases\n    \ndl/db = dl/dz * dl/db = Sumofbatch( dl/dz) - sum across rows\n\n- inputs:\n\ndl/dx = dl/dz1 * w11 + dl/dz2 * w21 + dl/dz3 * w31\n\ndl/dx = dl/dz * WT",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
